  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Off finansiell styrning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Publ financial management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polad finansiering genom en gemensam fond administrerad av Rwanda     till st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av strategin f&#xf6;r reformering av OFS.      Strategin &#xe4;mnar st&#xe4;rka tj&#xe4;nstem&#xe4;ns kompetens, sj&#xf6;s&#xe4;tta moderna och    effektiva system f&#xf6;r OFS och st&#xe4;rka det institutionella ramverket f&#xf6;r OFS i &#xf6;verensst&#xe4;mmelse b&#xe4;sta internationella praxis.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pooled funding through a GoR governed basket in support of the        implementation of the PFM reform strategy. The strategy focuses on    building human resource capacity, putting in place modern and         effective systems and procedures for effective financial management   and reporting and on strengthening institutional frameworks for PFM   in accordance with international best practices.</narrative>
  </description>
